PwC 1st technical interview round 

The interview focused heavily on hands-on DevOps fundamentals and scripting knowledge, along with real-world tool-based questions.

Sharing some of the key questions discussed — this might help others preparing for PwC or similar DevOps roles 👇

🔹 Bash Scripting
Write a bash script to find the top 5 largest files in a directory and display their size.

🔹 Python Scripting
Write a Python script to read a log file and count how many times the word “ERROR” appears.

🔹 AWS
Explain the difference between EC2, ECS, and EKS. When would you use each?
Difference between Security Groups and NACLs.
How does IAM role differ from IAM user?
What happens if an EC2 instance is stopped vs terminated?
Difference between ALB, NLB, and CLB.
How does Auto Scaling work with ALB?
What is VPC peering and its limitations?
Difference between S3 and EBS.

🔹 Git
What is the difference between git merge and git rebase?
How do you resolve merge conflicts?

🔹 GitHub Actions
How does a GitHub Actions workflow get triggered?
Explain the structure of a GitHub Actions YAML file.

🔹 GitLab CI/CD
Difference between GitHub Actions and GitLab CI/CD?
What are stages and jobs in GitLab pipelines?
Explain the structure of a .gitlab-ci.yml file.
What are stages, jobs, and pipelines in GitLab?
Difference between artifacts and cache in GitLab.
How do GitLab runners work?
What is a protected branch and protected variable?
How do you trigger pipelines manually in GitLab?

🔹 Docker
Difference between Docker image and container.
What is a multi-stage Docker build and why is it used?

🔹 Kubernetes
Difference between Deployment, StatefulSet, and DaemonSet.
How does Kubernetes perform rolling updates?
How does Kubernetes handle pod restarts and failures?
What happens when a node goes into NotReady state?
Difference between ClusterIP, NodePort, and LoadBalancer services.
How do liveness and readiness probes work?
What is the purpose of ConfigMaps and Secrets?
How does Horizontal Pod Autoscaler work internally?
Difference between Ingress and Service.
What is the use of namespaces in Kubernetes?
How do you troubleshoot a pod stuck in CrashLoopBackOff?

🔹 Terraform
What is the Terraform state file?
Difference between terraform plan and terraform apply.



